              "text": "Compute the sum $u_1 + u_5$:\n$$u_1 + u_5 = \\frac{4}{3} + 108 = \\frac{4}{3} + \\frac{324}{3} = \\frac{328}{3} \\quad \\left(109\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$$"
